{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-24002","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24002-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24002-0","text":"存护命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24002-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24002-1","text":"宇宙像一片堆满垃圾的生荒地。\n偶有琳琅，无人捡拾。\n祂翻阅往日的罅隙，拣选记忆的种子\n——新的生命要是萌芽，它的种子须是死的。\n粉色、蓝色、白色的宝石被带了来，\n在祂的苗圃中轻盈闪烁，\n但宇宙依旧寂静如谜。","speaker":""}]}
